===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# Something that [[rectifies]].
# A [[device]] that [[convert]]s [[alternating current]] into [[direct current]]; often a [[diode]].
# {{label|en|nautical}} An [[instrument]] used for determining and rectifying the variations of the [[compass]] on board ship.
# {{lb|en|artificial neural networks}} The [[activation function]] <math>f(x) = \max(0, x)</math>, where ''x'' is the [[input]] to a [[neuron]].

